2ovcwj.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E4%BE%BF%E6%90%BA%E6%B2%BB%E6%84%88%E9%AD%94%E8%8D%AF.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/53/8hl0dvm7heupg23cphhq8m7om2ovcwj.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E4%BE%BF%E6%90%BA%E6%B2%BB%E6%84%88%E9%AD%94%E8%8D%AF.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/53/8hl0dvm7heupg23cphhq8m7om2ovcwj.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />便携治愈魔药\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[职业技能]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（被动）行动结束时，治疗自身范围3格内生命百分比最低的友军，治疗量为魔攻值的<font color=\"#58cb48\">50%</font>，若目标为〈时空旅者〉，治疗后使其获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲物防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲物防2</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲魔防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲魔防2</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%89%B9%E8%8E%89%E4%B8%9D\" title=\"角色图鉴库/特莉丝\"><img alt=\"头像 特莉丝.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1f/gpqvn0pzn481yc3i2kcq3py4j6cxyqb.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">特莉丝</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022124830\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.412 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.558 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9486/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 154684/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14848/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  534.520      1 模板:简单技能\n100.00%  534.520      1 -total\n  6.99%   37.384      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n  6.27%   33.513      3 模板:中括号介绍\n  2.06%   11.009      1 模板:面包屑\n  0.96%    5.152      1 模板:列表/头像\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:6834-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022124829 and revision id 15315. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"技能","missing":true},{"sortkey":"","category":"粉碎者技能","missing":true}],"images":["技能_便携治愈魔药.png","头像_特莉丝.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"<b>便携治愈魔药</b>","number":"1","index":"T-1","fromtitle":"模板:简单技能","byteoffse